@startuml
!include theme.puml
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "CLI Lapangan" as cli
participant "Auth Service" as auth
database Redis
cli -> auth : client_credentials\nID + secret
auth -> Redis : hash refresh + family\nTTL sesi
 auth --> cli : JWT 60 s + refresh
... TTL 60 s berlalu alami ...
cli -> auth : refresh_token\nserial, bukan paralel
auth -> Redis : Lua: validasi\nfamily, used, TTL
alt refresh belum dipakai
Redis -> Redis : refresh lama used\nsimpan refresh baru
Redis --> auth : sukses
auth --> cli : JWT + refresh baru
else refresh lama dipakai ulang
Redis -> Redis : revoke family
Redis --> auth : reuse
 auth --> cli : 400 invalid_grant
end
note over cli,auth
JWT baru dapat dipakai di client-api.
JWT lama yang expired tetap ditolak 401.
end note
note over cli,Redis
Atomisitas Redis tidak mencakup respons HTTP.
Respons hilang dapat memerlukan login ulang.
end note
@enduml
